Th-that Trainer Card!
That wonderful shade! That sparkle!{VAR BE01}
I've seen several Trainers with
Silver Trainer Cards already...{VAR BE01}
But you're the first to top them all with
that impressive Trainer Card.{VAR BE01}
Oh, {VAR 0100 0000}, may I please heal
your Pokémon?

Oh... It looks like your Pokémon may be
infected with the Pokérus.{VAR BE01}
Little is known about the Pokérus,
except that it is a microscopic life-form{VAR BE00}
that attaches to Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
While infected, Pokémon are said to
grow exceptionally well.

Welcome to the Pokémon Wireless
Club Union Room.{VAR BE01}
You may interact directly with
many Trainers here.{VAR BE01}
Would you like to enter the room?

The Trainers in the Union Room
will be those players around you{VAR BE00}
who have also entered the room.{VAR BE01}
You may trade your Pokémon here
or have battles for two or four.{VAR BE01}
Also, you may exchange Eggs
or draw pictures with other players.{VAR BE01}
You may also chat with other
players in the room.{VAR BE01}
Or you may find friends by touching
the spoken words.{VAR BE01}
Would you like to enter the room?

Wait, Trainer!{VAR BE01}
Your title on your Trainer Card
is still just “Pokémon Trainer," isn't it?{VAR BE01}
If you change your title, you can easily
project your image to others when you{VAR BE00}
greet them in the Union Room.{VAR BE01}
Let's see...
